# Fixed LTB Evidence Brief Generator

I've addressed all the issues identified. Here's the complete fixed notebook with explanations of every change.

## Summary of Fixes

| Issue | Fix Applied |
|-------|------------|
| PDF rasterization loses text | Direct PDF page merging via PyMuPDF |
| DOCX/XLSX without LibreOffice = broken | Clear error messaging + improved fallback |
| Text/CSV whitespace destroyed | `XPreformatted` + CSV table renderer |
| XLSX text extraction loses columns | Proper ReportLab `Table` with grid lines |
| Small images not scaled up | Configurable upscaling to fill page |
| Document pages have no captions | Added file name + page number captions |
| LibreOffice naming collision | UUID-based temp names before conversion |
| No size guard on conversion | File size check before LibreOffice |
| Tab characters lost | Whitespace-preserving rendering |

