## Key Changes Explained

### 1. Direct PDF Merging (not rasterization)

The biggest fix. Instead of converting PDF pages to images (which destroys text selectability), the new code:

1. Builds a "skeleton" PDF with placeholder pages using ReportLab
2. Uses PyMuPDF to replace each placeholder with the actual PDF page
3. Adds footers (page numbers) to the merged pages

